Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:02.20,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}When a car\Ngoes into water,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:04.24,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}you get about\None {\1c&H47C2FF&}minute{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:07.35,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The first night after\Nthe clocks went back,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:09.73,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}it got dark\Nan hour earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:12.07,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The car hit the water —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:13.02,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}and floated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:14.67,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}In tests, cars floated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:16.84,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}about fifteen\Nseconds to a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:18.86,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}before water\Nreached the {\1c&H47C2FF&}windows{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.08,0:00:19.88,S1_Chip,,0,0,742,,{\3c&H50A67F&\4c&H50A67F&}OWEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:19.88,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The door.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.90,0:00:21.32,S1_Chip,,0,0,742,,{\3c&H50A67F&\4c&H50A67F&}OWEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.90,0:00:21.32,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Get the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:23.74,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Water was pressing\Non the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:27.28,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}It wouldn't open until\Nthe car was nearly {\1c&H7A8AFF&}full{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.50,0:00:28.91,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Door, or window?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.45,0:00:31.98,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The way out\Nis the {\1c&H47C2FF&}window{\1c&HFFFFFF&} —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:34.37,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}while the car\Nis still floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:35.32,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Belt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:36.37,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Window down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:38.83,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Then {\1c&H47C2FF&}out{\1c&HFFFFFF&} —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:41.26,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}before the water\Nreached the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.02,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Most people\Ntry the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:51.25,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}The ones who make it out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:52.57,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}use the {\1c&H47C2FF&}window{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
